      'stops drifting and reaches the edges.<br>' +
      'While this screen is open your console does not see the controller, so nothing you press reaches a game.<br>' +
      'Use the controller’s buttons: ○ Circle centres the sticks and ✕ Cross confirms and saves. ' +
      'Range and fine-tune only open when you tap them here, so a stray press never starts one.';
    return z.helpHTML ? z.helpHTML('pcal-how', 'Calibration', text) : '';
  }
